      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't agree with your statement, \"dynamic bones is like the biggest thing affecting performance,\" as I haven't experienced any lag from people with lots of dynamic bones alone. Materials are way more inefficient. lots of models are directly imported from mmd without atlasing. It's likely people with lots of dynamic bones have lots of materials. Although, I do agree there should be an option to disable dynamic bones for those who want it.\n \n[System specs]\nDELL WMR  1440x2880\nRX 480\nI5 4670\n8gb Ram\n \nEDIT: There is another thread about this subject. Share the love to show this is an option that the community wants. https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/toggle-dynamic-bones-option-1",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
